, textile waste, recycled clothing, fishing nets, etc.\\\",\\n      \\\"icon\\\": \\\"ico-recycled-materials\\\",\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"recycled-materials\\\",\\n      \\\"index\\\": \\\"false\\\"\\n      }\\n      \\n      ,\\n          \\n  \\n    {\\n        \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n       \\n       \\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Bluesign Approved Materials\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"These materials were made in Bluesign® certified facilities, which are held to the highest standards of safety, environmental impact and responsible resource use. \\\",\\n      \\\"icon\\\": \\\"ico-bluesign\\\",\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"bluesign-approved-materials\\\",\\n      \\\"index\\\": \\\"false\\\"\\n      }\\n      \\n      ,\\n          \\n  \\n    {\\n        \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n       \\n       \\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Sustainable Trim\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"The trims used in this style are made from recycled or responsibly sourced materials. \\\",\\n      \\\"icon\\\": \\\"ico-sustainable-trim\\\",\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"sustainable-trim\\\",\\n      \\\"index\\\": \\\"false\\\"\\n      }\\n      \\n      ,\\n          \\n  \\n    {\\n        \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n       \\n       \\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Recycled Polyester\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"This polyester fabric was made from recycling plastics and \\/ or synthetic textiles.\\\",\\n      \\\"icon\\\": \\\"ico-recycled-polyester\\\",\\n      \\\"key\\\": \\\"recycled-polyester\\\",\\n      \\\"index\\\": \\\"true\\\"\\n      }\\n          \\n  \\n  ]\\n}\"'\n                        material-description=\"Shell: 150D, 100% Recycled Polyester with PFC-free DWR\nLining: 200D, 100% Recycled Polyester \nAir Mesh: 100% Recycled Polyester \nMechanically recycled NATULON® YKK zipper tape\nNon-stretch woven fabric\"\n                        fabric-composition=\"100% Recycled Polyester\"\n                        :fabric-composition-link='{\"text\":\"Learn about our Sustainable Materials.\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tentree.ca\\/pages\\/materials\"}'\n                        productcare-bullets=\"Spot clean as needed\"\n                        productcare-description=\"\"\n                        origin-description=\"&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#39;/pages/ethical-manufacturing&#39;&gt;Designed in Canada, ethically made in &lt;u&gt;Indonesia&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;\"\n                        :origin-link='{\"text\":\"Learn about our Ethical Manufacturing.\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tentree.ca\\/pages\\/ethical-manufacturing\"}'\n                        :text=\"{\n                          materials_title: 'Materials',\n                          fabriccomposition_title: 'Fabric composition',\n                          productcare_title: 'Product care',\n                          manufacturing_title: 'Manufacturing'\n                        }\">\n</materials-care-section-2025>\n                    </div>\n                  </template>\n                </collapsible-item>\n              </div>\n\n              \n              <div>\n                <data-provider store-front-api-token=\"70cad315d6cc9f3392de54c3369cbb82\" store-type=\"production\">\n                  <complete-the-look-2025 product-handle=\"ruxton-packable-backpack-mauve-stone\" />\n                </data-provider>\n              </div>\n\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        \n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style style=\"text/css\">\n  body {\n    background-color: #fff;\n  }\n  .pdp-breadcrumb-wrapper {\n    min-height: 20px;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .pdp-breadcrumb {\n    line-height: 18px;\n  }\n  .breadcrumb-list {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .breadcrumb-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .breadcrumb-link {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: color 0